                à§³ {Number(
                  voidingCustomerPayment?.amount ||
                  voidingCustomerPayment?.credit ||
                  0
                ).toLocaleString("en-BD")}
              </h2>

              <small>
                Method: {voidingCustomerPayment?.paymentMethod || "-"}
